# Independent operational repos nested in the realm (under Executive/ after the four-branch
# refactor). Each is its own git repo (or plain dir); the public VJS tracks only the governance
# machinery + realm structure, never the departments' contents (Bill 27: system data only).
/Executive/ministry-of-business-engineering-and-skills/engineering-department/projects/
# Typo-path guard: private project material has appeared here locally; keep it out of public VJS too.
/Executive/ministry-of-business-engineering-and-skills/engineing-department/projects/
/Executive/ministry-of-business-engineering-and-skills/legal-department/*
/Executive/ministry-of-business-engineering-and-skills/skills-and-education/*
/Executive/ministry-of-business-engineering-and-skills/business-operations/*
/Executive/national-archives/

# Ministry of Data Security private operational estate registry - PRIVATE (the facts: the master
# digital estate registry, the repo->server-config list, and policy papers). The public law
# (REALM-SI 1) states principles only; the facts never enter the public tree (Bill 27 s.14; Bill 22).
/Executive/ministry-of-data-security/_private-estate/

# Ministry / court private working papers - repo-local facts, client/project identifiers, and
# unredacted evidence stay out of the public superrepo record. Public policy/court files should
# contain only system data, anonymised facts, or redacted pointers.
/_private/*
!/_private/.gitignore
!/_private/README.md
/Judicature/requests/_private/
/Judicature/ministry-of-justice/policy/_private/
/Legislature/legislature/committee/referrals/_private/

# Repos House private registers (operational facts of the registers; the public schema is committed at
# repos-house/register-schemas.md). Principles-at-law / facts-in-the-private-store (Bill 27 s.5A(3); REALM-SI 6).
/Executive/ministry-of-business-engineering-and-skills/repos-house/_private-registers/

# Secrets and build artefacts - never commit
**/node_modules/
**/.env
.env
*.env.local
Judicature/law-reports/node_modules/
Judicature/law-reports/review-service/node_modules/
Judicature/law-reports/review-service/data/

# OS / editor junk - never belongs in the repo (and never in a public VJS)
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
._*
**/._*
*.swp
Thumbs.db
